      "writtenOn": "2021-05-12T16:14:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CBRS might (in theory) be considered location sensitive. It is not considered as such within the scope of the APIs/information available here.\n\nFor instance, a CBRS network\u0027s subscription ID and even the name of the newtork operator are not considered location sensitive. If that changes then it should change in all places equally, but I would expect that change to be driven by telephony. This CL doesn\u0027t attempt to change the state of the world, only to align with it.",
      "parentUuid": "eee41161_866dea88",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9087,
        "startChar": 81,
        "endLine": 9088,
        "endChar": 57
      },
